      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.4.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But know that Jehovah hath set apart for himself him that is godly:\nJehovah will hear when I call unto him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.4.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.4.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Stand in awe, and sin not:\nCommune with your own heart upon your bed, and be still. [Selah",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.4.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.4.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Offer the sacrifices of righteousness,\nAnd put your trust in Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.4.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.4.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many there are that say, Who will show us ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "any",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good?\nJehovah, lift thou up the light of thy countenance upon us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.4.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PSA.4.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast put gladness in my heart,\nMore than ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they have",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " when their grain and their new wine are increased.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
